# bundle_name|gradle_project|loom_refmap
# Minecraft 26.3's in-house client mods, selected like the mod list
# (mc_client_mods_manifest in scripts/lib.sh). The companion is optional and
# effect-only: the server needs no client mod to join (decisions.md RB-02,
# RB-03). "-" in the refmap column: the project builds with Loom's
# non-remapping plugin, so the jar carries no refmap.
